=== Mob loot ===
[[Zombie]]s, [[husk]]s, [[zombie villager]]s, [[skeleton]]s, [[stray]]s and [[bogged]] that spawn with armor have an 8.5% chance of dropping their armor when killed by the [[player]]. The dropped armor has a random [[durability]] and retains any enchantments it has.

There is a 0.04% chance of that armor being diamond armor.

