=== Damage reduction ===
{{main|Armor#Damage reduction}}Wearing armor reduces incoming damage according to two values: <abbr title="armor points">armor</abbr>, and armor toughness. Each piece of armor provides a given <abbr title="armor points">armor</abbr> and armor toughness value, and the values from each armor piece are added together when calculating damage reduction.

The strength of incoming damage also determines the damage reduction of worn armor, as armor does not protect in a linear fashion.
